From a80754c336199a556761a7f106b2d17c38bd127c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 09:43:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] generic-parallel: Arcane backend

Accelerator API of Arccore, the core component of the Arcane framework,
on the queue given by the execution policy, atomic operations of Arccore,
statistics in the memory of the device of the queue, made the current
device during the call (configuration arcane, main branch of Arcane from
its commit 51b90b8).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
